  m_Name: help_scents
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Antarium.Content::Antarium.Content.HelpTopicDef
  id: help_scents
  displayName: Pheromones
  order: 340
  category: Colony
  icon: tool_scent
  body: 'Press {Scent} to paint scents; {Previous} / {Next} pick one, right drag erases.

    - Trail: ants walk faster along it and prefer it. Lay it along busy tunnels.

    - Dig here: mining orders under it are dug first.

    - Gather: piles on it are picked up first.

    - Defend: soldiers patrol it.

    - Avoid: ants keep out of it and take no jobs inside.


    Scents fade after a few minutes. A Pheromone Emitter (research Scent Glands) keeps one scent fresh around it: paint the area first, then place the emitter.'
  reveal: 0
  revealBiome: {fileID: 0}
  revealResearch: {fileID: 0}
